pared to our major peers in the royalty and streaming sector.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2025 Q2","e":"rgld","d":"2025-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Libner","x":"Finally, we are maintaining our 2025 guidance ranges for metal sales, DD&A, and tax rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2025 Q2","e":"rgld","d":"2025-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Martin Raffield","x":"And given that, we are maintaining our 2025 guidance range at this stage in the year even though those have been offset somewhat by Milligan underperformance in Zaventina guidance reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2025 Q4","e":"rgld","d":"2026-02-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Tanya Jakusconek","x":"Sorry, I just wanted to clarify that, that it wasn't just the streaming portion of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/royal-gold-rgld-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2025 Q4","e":"rgld","d":"2026-02-19","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"William Heissenbuttel","x":"And I think the nice thing about transactions like Antamina is, if you can get a BHP to do streaming, that just opens the market to almost every mining company, including companies that were probably resistant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/royal-gold-rgld-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q1","e":"rgld","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"William H. Heissenbuttel","x":"In keeping with our strategy, we plan to rationalize non-core assets acquired through the Sandstorm transaction and, where possible, convert those into holdings that are more consistent with our royalty and streaming business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/royal-gold-rgld-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q1","e":"rgld","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"William H. Heissenbuttel","x":"We are not directly exposed to the price of diesel, to tariffs, or to inflation in general.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/royal-gold-rgld-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q1","e":"rgld","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul K. Libner","x":"Metal price increases were significant: gold up 70%, silver up 165%, and copper up 38% over the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/royal-gold-rgld-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q1","e":"rgld","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"William H. Heissenbuttel","x":"During the quarter, we also completed the restructuring of the Bear Creek debt and equity investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/royal-gold-rgld-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q1","e":"rgld","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"William H. Heissenbuttel","x":"The Bear Creek restructuring was a multi-step transaction, and we were successful in converting those interests into cash, Calibre Silver shares, and royalties on the Corani project and Mercedes mine.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/royal-gold-rgld-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q2","e":"rgld","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Heissenbuttel","x":"Hod Maden is a high-grade and high-margin project, and we are pleased to preserve the value of our position while bringing our overall interest more in line with our core royalty and streaming business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q2","e":"rgld","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Libner","x":"Metal price increases were significant with gold up 37%, silver up 117% and copper up 40%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q2","e":"rgld","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Heissenbuttel","x":"We announced the restructuring of our ownership in the Hod Maden joint venture.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q2","e":"rgld","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Heissenbuttel","x":"Over the past few months, we have streamlined the Horizon structure, divested non-core equity positions, restructured the Bear Creek investments, settled the Relief Canyon obligations and made progress on restructuring the direct equity interest in Hod Maden.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/royal-gold-rgld-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q3","e":"rgld","d":"2026-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Heissenbuttel","x":"And that -- we always say, it only takes one to get others prompted to at least look at streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/royal-gold-rgld-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q3","e":"rgld","d":"2026-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William Heissenbuttel","x":"The Australians had never previously wanted to consider streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/royal-gold-rgld-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RGLD 2026 Q3","e":"rgld","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Martin Raffield","x":"Based on strong year-to-date sales, we have raised our full year guidance for other metals, and we expect to be at or above the top end of the guidance ranges for silver and copper sales."